{"version":1,"content":"<p>佳能與珊瑚繁育機構Coral Spawning International合作，使用醫院級超聲設備掃描活體珊瑚，觀察其內部正在發育的卵細胞。佳能稱，這是首次利用醫療超聲對活珊瑚進行此類無創檢查，有望幫助研究人員判斷珊瑚繁殖階段，為珊瑚礁修復和繁育提供新工具。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585626.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.788932+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:25:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_hash":"0f8b0f3a3da223c6d2d9a045722f73acaf1d10956d2ee828b500b8eb22f67a18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}